WEBVTT

00:04.610 --> 00:07.150
Tae-san, you seem well again today.

00:07.150 --> 00:11.150
You know, every once in a while, 
you could just lay out in the sunlight.

00:11.150 --> 00:14.660
It's hard to believe you're over eighty.

00:14.660 --> 00:18.340
I can't go without being active.

00:18.340 --> 00:21.760
And you could definitely use some 
exercise every once in a while.

00:21.760 --> 00:23.750
Well, I'm a cat.

00:23.750 --> 00:28.440
Cats don't speak so eloquently, 
nor do they drink alcohol.

00:29.430 --> 00:34.260
<i>I found this cat on my doorstep, weakened, 
about six months ago after a lot of rain.</i>

00:34.700 --> 00:38.510
<i>I let him into my house because it would've 
been a pain if he died on me, but...</i>

00:38.510 --> 00:40.860
<i>He just hasn't left since.</i>

00:44.940 --> 00:47.520
What do you want? I can't give you sake.

00:49.520 --> 00:52.340
Just a sip. Just one sip!

00:55.410 --> 00:58.240
<i>I had no idea I was dealing with a bakeneko.</i>

00:58.980 --> 01:01.240
Oh? Going out for a jog?

01:01.240 --> 01:02.510
Yup.

01:04.250 --> 01:06.120
Well, have a good time.

02:45.400 --> 02:46.990
No good again today?

02:47.520 --> 02:48.790
Oh, Tae-san!

02:48.790 --> 02:50.270
It happened again!

02:50.270 --> 02:54.270
So many dead fish yet again. 
This clearly isn't normal!

02:54.270 --> 02:57.400
And you still don't know 
how all the fish died?

02:57.400 --> 03:00.590
We've had the prefectural 
college look into it,

03:00.590 --> 03:03.380
but they couldn't find anything 
particularly wrong with the fish.

03:03.380 --> 03:07.040
They couldn't detect any poison, 
nor signs of suffocation.

03:07.040 --> 03:09.390
There's no red tide right now, either.

03:09.390 --> 03:14.000
If anything, it seems like 
the fish are dying from shock.

03:14.000 --> 03:16.630
Seaweed, jellyfish, and 
mollusks are being hit, too.

03:17.280 --> 03:20.380
We're getting far fewer customers 
here to fish because of it.

03:20.380 --> 03:23.430
We'll probably have even more 
cancellations over the weekend.

03:23.430 --> 03:26.390
I hear fewer customers are visiting 
the cafeteria and the shop, too.

03:26.390 --> 03:29.390
Who knows what'll happen if 
we can't figure out the cause?

03:30.750 --> 03:32.900
Come on, you're all grown men here.

03:32.900 --> 03:37.400
A month of bad luck doesn't 
mean you need to panic.

03:37.780 --> 03:41.340
Honestly, things were going too well 
for you right before last summer.

03:41.340 --> 03:43.500
All because of that TV drama.

03:43.160 --> 03:46.660
<b>Yellowtail Head Detective</b>

03:43.160 --> 03:46.660
<b>Authentic seafood
suspense starts fresh 
every Tuesday at 10 PM!</b>

03:43.160 --> 03:46.660
<b>Notice</b>

03:43.160 --> 03:46.660
<b>This is what you saw in the drama! 
Come stop by the Cafeteria Yellowtail</b>

03:43.500 --> 03:46.660
And because of that, you all made about 
three times more than the summer before.

03:46.660 --> 03:48.680
Last year was great.

03:48.680 --> 03:51.660
So many people came by wanting 
to eat the food from the drama.

03:51.660 --> 03:53.990
We almost ran out of fish.

03:54.420 --> 03:58.100
Most things in this world 
are made to be balanced.

03:58.100 --> 04:01.800
In the end, good luck and 
bad luck are about equal.

04:02.190 --> 04:07.050
The god of the sea is keeping you 
all in check for getting cocky.

04:07.520 --> 04:10.060
You'll just have to continue 
to keep an eye on things.

04:10.060 --> 04:12.940
And if the fish keep dying 
weird deaths like this,

04:12.940 --> 04:15.690
you may want to consider having 
a purification ritual conducted.

04:18.130 --> 04:19.690
Tae-san, wait!

04:19.690 --> 04:21.940
A purification ritual, huh?

04:21.940 --> 04:26.220
You know, this just might 
be Zenta-san's curse.

04:30.200 --> 04:31.600
<i>Zenta...</i>

04:32.910 --> 04:36.240
<i>Tohira Zenta was born here 
and grew up in this town,</i>

04:36.240 --> 04:39.040
<i>and wasn't the type 
who'd ever leave this place.</i>

04:39.040 --> 04:42.550
<i>Zenta's son left the town 
and started a family.</i>

04:42.550 --> 04:45.800
<i>Last summer, his son came home,</i>

04:45.800 --> 04:50.990
<i>bringing his wife and Zenta's grandson, 
a ten-year-old boy named Tsubasa.</i>

04:52.830 --> 04:58.560
<i>But Tsubasa was run over 
by a tourist and died.</i>

04:58.560 --> 05:01.580
<i>The four college students 
who were in the car</i>

05:01.580 --> 05:05.570
<i>were talking and fooling around, 
not paying attention to the road.</i>

05:05.570 --> 05:09.580
<i>Apparently, Zenta's grandson was still 
breathing when he was first run over.</i>

05:09.580 --> 05:11.030
<i>But because it was summer vacation,</i>

05:11.030 --> 05:13.320
<i>the town was filled with 
cars belonging to tourists,</i>

05:13.320 --> 05:15.610
<i>and there were many 
who were illegally parked,</i>

05:15.610 --> 05:17.830
<i>delaying the ambulance,</i>

05:17.830 --> 05:21.790
<i>and he ended up dying 
on the way to the hospital.</i>

05:23.380 --> 05:25.250
<i>After his grandson's death,</i>

05:25.250 --> 05:28.140
<i>Zenta always looked so upset 
with how unfair this all was.</i>

05:28.730 --> 05:31.040
<i>Then, last month, he died of heart failure,</i>

05:31.040 --> 05:33.420
<i>as though he no longer had the will to live.</i>

05:34.640 --> 05:38.150
<i>After that happened is 
when the fish started dying.</i>

05:38.940 --> 05:40.840
T-Tae-san!

05:40.840 --> 05:43.960
For crying out loud, Mayor. 
Lose some weight.

05:44.530 --> 05:47.400
Tae-san, so what's actually going on?

05:47.400 --> 05:49.170
What's that supposed to mean?

05:49.170 --> 05:53.410
Don't tell me you also think it's some 
unscientific thing like a curse.

05:53.410 --> 05:55.670
But... Zenta-san didn't seem very happy

05:55.670 --> 05:59.080
with all the extra tourists 
or those who came to fish.

05:59.080 --> 06:03.410
They kept throwing away garbage wherever 
and taking photos without permission.

06:03.000 --> 06:08.260
<b>No Trespassing</b>

06:03.410 --> 06:04.930
Police incidents increased,

06:04.930 --> 06:07.930
and in the end, his grandson 
died in that accident...

06:08.560 --> 06:13.910
So you're trying to say that someone's 
cursing the fish to die unknown deaths

06:13.910 --> 06:16.030
so that no one will come here anymore?

06:16.560 --> 06:20.210
I'm sure Zenta resented the tourists,

06:20.210 --> 06:25.190
but chasing them away only 
would've hurt this town even more.

06:22.690 --> 06:25.190
<b>Welcome to
Port Totomizu!!</b>

06:25.190 --> 06:28.490
If the fish keep dying mysterious deaths, 
people will stop coming here,

06:28.490 --> 06:33.330
jobs will be lost, and the 
people here will leave the area.

06:33.330 --> 06:38.070
That would mean it's the town 
being cursed, not the tourists.

06:38.070 --> 06:43.460
But perhaps Zenta-san resented 
the whole town regarding Tsubasa-kun.

06:43.460 --> 06:45.310
When Tsubasa-kun's accident occurred,

06:45.310 --> 06:47.760
the first thing most people 
were worried about was

06:47.760 --> 06:50.530
the news of the accident getting out 
and tarnishing this town's image,

06:47.760 --> 06:52.390
<b>Welcome to Port Totomizu!!</b>

06:47.760 --> 06:52.390
Keep
the ocean
beautiful

06:50.530 --> 06:52.390
leading to fewer tourists coming in.

06:52.390 --> 06:54.510
That's why it was said that

06:54.510 --> 06:58.430
people tried to tell Zenta-san and his 
family not to talk about the accident.

06:58.430 --> 07:02.130
Even though those college students 
were at fault for that accident,

07:02.130 --> 07:05.940
some secretly insisted that 
Tsubasa-kun wasn't being careful.

07:05.940 --> 07:09.570
I'm sure Zenta-san heard about that, as well.

07:09.570 --> 07:14.580
Don't you think Zenta-san might have wanted 
something to happen to this town then?

07:14.580 --> 07:18.950
You know just as well as anyone else 
that Zenta was a kind man.

07:18.950 --> 07:21.710
To put a negative spin on that, 
you could say he was timid.

07:21.710 --> 07:23.370
But he was human.

07:23.370 --> 07:25.840
Of course he might've 
resented or hated someone,

07:25.840 --> 07:28.580
or even thought about killing someone.

07:28.580 --> 07:31.720
But he didn't have the guts to 
kill someone with his own hands

07:31.720 --> 07:34.540
or bring misfortune upon them himself.

07:34.540 --> 07:38.850
He definitely didn't have the strength 
to deal with the evil in this town.

07:38.850 --> 07:40.590
If he did, he would've been able

07:40.590 --> 07:43.140
to butt heads with those 
around him when he was alive.

07:43.140 --> 07:45.360
He wouldn't have just shut 
himself up in his home.

07:45.360 --> 07:47.060
Yes, I know that.

07:47.060 --> 07:49.110
But if he couldn't do this himself,

07:49.110 --> 07:52.850
what if he had something else do it for him?

07:54.550 --> 07:55.870
What do you mean by that?

07:55.870 --> 08:00.870
You know how after Tsubasa-kun died, 
Zenta-san was carving a doll out of wood?

08:00.870 --> 08:03.370
Do you know where it went?

08:04.880 --> 08:09.380
You're the one who found 
Zenta-san dead, right?

08:10.880 --> 08:14.390
Was the doll at his house then?

08:19.540 --> 08:20.520
Zenta!

08:20.520 --> 08:23.390
Zenta! Zenta, are you home?

08:24.350 --> 08:27.020
Are you still working on that thing?

08:27.020 --> 08:28.960
You should go out every once in a while.

08:35.780 --> 08:38.780
You finally finished that doll?

08:45.570 --> 08:47.790
Zenta, this is enough, isn't it?

08:47.790 --> 08:49.660
Doing all this isn't going to...

08:50.920 --> 08:52.220
Zenta?

08:54.630 --> 08:56.800
We'll come by to ask you 
some questions later.

08:57.230 --> 08:58.570
Please head outside.

08:58.570 --> 08:59.570
Sure.

09:01.650 --> 09:05.700
Even if he did just die alone, 
we will be investigating the scene,

09:05.700 --> 09:08.310
so please make sure not to move anything.

09:11.320 --> 09:13.220
Who knows?

09:13.220 --> 09:16.660
If it was in a closet, 
no one would've noticed.

09:16.660 --> 09:21.450
That doll looked like it was about 
the size of the late Tsubasa-kun.

09:21.820 --> 09:25.960
There were rumors that he was 
making it to take his grandson's place.

09:25.960 --> 09:27.370
And...

09:27.370 --> 09:30.870
there are people saying they've seen 
something resembling that doll

09:30.870 --> 09:34.740
heading down to the ocean at night.

09:35.280 --> 09:36.970
That makes it sound like...

09:36.970 --> 09:39.960
that doll either embodied Tsubasa-kun's soul

09:39.960 --> 09:43.640
or is moving around 
through Zenta-san's will.

09:43.640 --> 09:44.630
You know...

09:44.630 --> 09:47.940
Doesn't it remind you of Pinocchio?

09:48.830 --> 09:52.480
In that story, a puppet named 
Pinocchio, made by an old man,

09:52.480 --> 09:55.540
was given a soul by a fairy or something,

09:55.540 --> 09:59.360
and in the end, turns into a real human boy.

09:59.360 --> 10:01.370
Pinocchio, eh?

10:01.370 --> 10:03.770
Maybe that's what Zenta-san was going for,

10:03.770 --> 10:08.120
since he gave that doll a really long nose.

10:08.120 --> 10:12.630
All the more reason it seems like it might 
just start moving around like Pinocchio.

10:12.630 --> 10:14.900
So you're saying the doll 
is carrying out Zenta's will

10:14.900 --> 10:18.630
and killing a bunch of fish 
in the middle of the night.

10:18.630 --> 10:21.610
Pinocchio never had powers like that.

10:21.610 --> 10:23.640
Maybe not, but...

10:23.640 --> 10:28.520
Also, the Pinocchio you're talking 
about is the movie Pinocchio.

10:28.520 --> 10:31.130
In the original novel, 
<i>The Adventures of Pinocchio</i>...

10:33.410 --> 10:37.530
Anyway, the original isn't 
such a heartwarming story.

10:37.530 --> 10:40.580
A doll that was left behind 
moving on its own,

10:40.580 --> 10:43.330
killing people and causing disasters,

10:43.330 --> 10:46.040
is something that happens in plenty 
of ghost stories and horror movies.

10:46.040 --> 10:51.860
The rumors you heard about the doll walking 
around probably resulted from the fact

10:51.860 --> 10:55.870
that you knew Zenta was making a doll

10:55.870 --> 10:58.220
and linking that with all of the fish dying.

10:58.220 --> 11:01.920
Don't you go saying this 
in front of other people.

11:01.920 --> 11:05.950
Of course I won't! 
That's why I'm talking to you, Tae-san.

11:05.950 --> 11:06.850
But...

11:06.850 --> 11:10.220
If we don't do anything about that doll,

11:10.220 --> 11:13.940
I have a bad feeling that 
something awful might happen.

11:13.940 --> 11:16.110
Zenta's curse, eh?

11:16.500 --> 11:18.690
So Zenta couldn't sully his own hands,

11:18.690 --> 11:22.740
but you think he'd let 
his doll do his dirty work.

11:22.740 --> 11:27.990
We can at least get him pardoned, 
saying that the doll acted on its own accord.

11:27.990 --> 11:30.180
What an awful thought.

11:32.200 --> 11:34.450
Start preparing a purification ritual.

11:34.450 --> 11:37.630
I'm sure it'd be hard to get 
the town's budget to cover that,

11:37.630 --> 11:40.260
so I'll go ahead and cover it for you.

11:40.740 --> 11:42.700
Make sure you prepare all 
the bells and whistles.

11:49.310 --> 11:54.040
<b>Electroshock Pinocchio</b>

12:04.870 --> 12:07.030
Hello. Welcome home.

12:07.030 --> 12:10.280
Who was that? One of your friends?

12:10.280 --> 12:12.790
Yes, we were enjoying a little chat.

12:12.790 --> 12:16.020
Don't go inviting weird things 
over to my house.

12:16.020 --> 12:19.470
I don't want to deal with 
any more ghosts or monsters.

12:19.470 --> 12:21.920
Oh, we won't be causing you 
too much trouble.

12:22.810 --> 12:27.190
I don't know if I'm happy 
I let you in that day or not.

12:27.190 --> 12:29.940
Well, I was quite weakened that day,

12:29.940 --> 12:32.560
so I am truly grateful!

12:32.560 --> 12:36.310
Then you should've just 
acted like a normal cat.

12:36.310 --> 12:41.490
Honestly, talking to me because you 
couldn't hold back your desire for alcohol...

12:41.490 --> 12:43.820
Ooh! Let me have some! Please! Please!

12:43.820 --> 12:48.990
If you're an actual bakeneko, why don't 
you rip me apart and take over my life?

12:48.990 --> 12:51.540
Then I'll be able to head into the next life

12:51.540 --> 12:55.740
and brag to my husband and kids 
that I died in the most unusual way.

12:55.740 --> 12:58.960
In the present day, taking over 
a human's life would just lead

12:58.960 --> 13:00.940
to dealing with neighbors and paying taxes.

13:00.940 --> 13:02.590
Quite disheartening, to say the least.

13:02.590 --> 13:06.500
Cats are happiest when 
they get to laze around.

13:06.500 --> 13:10.860
And I'm quite done with this 
disheartening world myself.

13:10.860 --> 13:15.190
The only good thing about 
meeting you is we agreed that

13:15.190 --> 13:20.670
if I died alone, you'd 
immediately go let someone know.

13:20.670 --> 13:25.000
Though, I must say that you 
might just outlive me, Tae-san.

13:25.590 --> 13:26.530
So...

13:26.530 --> 13:30.530
Do you happen to know anything 
about all those fish dying

13:30.530 --> 13:32.390
and the doll Zenta made?

13:32.800 --> 13:35.460
Doll? I haven't the slightest clue.

13:35.460 --> 13:36.790
Just spill the beans already.

13:37.220 --> 13:41.500
If the doll is involved, 
this is going to affect me, as well.

13:41.500 --> 13:44.760
If you continue playing dumb, 
I won't give you any more alcohol.

13:45.750 --> 13:49.470
B-But that's so cruel! Tae-san!

13:50.720 --> 13:53.600
I must insist that you keep this a secret,

13:53.600 --> 13:56.980
but I believe that doll will 
appear yet again tonight.

13:56.980 --> 13:59.230
The doll by itself?

14:01.130 --> 14:03.860
It will happen right after 1 AM.

14:04.300 --> 14:06.680
It will head down from 
the mountain to the ocean

14:06.680 --> 14:09.240
at the same time using the same path.

14:09.240 --> 14:13.890
Then it will appear on the beach 
right below your house.

14:14.700 --> 14:16.320
What in the world?!

14:16.960 --> 14:19.180
There are monsters everywhere!

14:19.180 --> 14:21.380
They're inhabitants of this town.

14:21.800 --> 14:25.130
They're all troubled by that doll, you see.

14:25.130 --> 14:29.630
Can't you monsters talk this out on your own?

14:29.630 --> 14:33.060
If it was reasonable at all, 
we wouldn't be so troubled about this.

14:33.060 --> 14:35.770
That thing doesn't understand 
what we're saying and—

14:37.100 --> 14:38.680
Tae-san! This way!

14:39.190 --> 14:40.720
Please hurry!

15:17.460 --> 15:19.550
The rock embedded in that thing's right hand...

15:19.550 --> 15:22.030
It's definitely Zenta's doll.

15:22.810 --> 15:26.450
Just how many unknowns are in this world?

15:26.450 --> 15:28.440
Please try not to move.

15:28.440 --> 15:31.590
We should be at a safe enough distance.

15:39.200 --> 15:40.600
That's a gorilla!

15:40.600 --> 15:42.980
No, that is one of our greatest allies...

15:42.980 --> 15:44.860
Master Shojo!

16:04.020 --> 16:05.980
And now, Okani-dono 
has moved in from behind!

16:28.280 --> 16:29.160
<i>He's fast!</i>

16:29.160 --> 16:30.920
Master! Dodge that!

17:03.050 --> 17:06.930
Not even masterful teamwork between 
Okani-dono and Master Shojo was enough!

17:14.510 --> 17:18.020
That doll released something from its hands.

17:19.180 --> 17:20.680
Electricity.

17:21.150 --> 17:24.010
That thing releases 
electricity without warning

17:24.010 --> 17:27.190
at anything that comes 
within seven to eight meters.

17:27.190 --> 17:31.440
If we just stay still, it won't 
do anything, even if we're nearby,

17:31.440 --> 17:34.940
but the moment you move to talk to it, 
it'll immediately shoot out electricity.

17:34.940 --> 17:38.340
It's so fast that we can't 
even get that close to it.

17:39.450 --> 17:42.700
We've tried to stop its 
destruction more than once,

17:42.700 --> 17:46.030
but we keep getting 
bested by its electricity.

17:46.030 --> 17:49.190
It appears as though it can only shoot 
electricity from its right hand,

17:49.190 --> 17:52.680
but its aim is incredibly accurate, 
even from far away.

17:52.680 --> 17:55.170
Even if we can dodge and get closer to it,

17:55.170 --> 17:58.930
if it sticks out its hand, 
we won't be able to get away.

17:58.930 --> 18:00.810
If the right hand is the only problem,

18:00.810 --> 18:04.310
couldn't you stop it if you 
all attacked it at once?

18:04.660 --> 18:07.870
Just imagining how many victims 
we'd lose in subduing it.

18:07.870 --> 18:10.560
You saw what happened with 
that masterful teamwork earlier.

18:10.910 --> 18:12.690
That thing is incredibly fast.

18:12.690 --> 18:17.260
It would just dodge us and douse us 
with electricity, and it'd be all over.

18:17.260 --> 18:19.880
But it is a frightening creature.

18:19.880 --> 18:21.700
We cannot just let it be.

18:21.700 --> 18:24.140
When it goes deep into the ocean like that,

18:24.140 --> 18:26.080
it emits that electricity as it moves about,

18:26.550 --> 18:29.540
and takes away countless lives with it.

18:34.340 --> 18:35.980
Unbelievable.

18:39.400 --> 18:42.720
Did Zenta hate this town so much

18:42.720 --> 18:45.410
that he willed this doll to do all this?

18:48.330 --> 18:52.480
That thing seems to dry itself off 
in the mountains during the day.

18:52.480 --> 18:54.890
We don't know where it goes.

18:54.890 --> 18:58.240
Some found the doll in the mountains 
and tried to get near it,

18:58.240 --> 19:01.870
but it shot out electricity at them 
and managed to get away.

19:01.870 --> 19:06.580
Goodness. Just how ridiculous 
are you supernatural creatures?

19:06.580 --> 19:08.370
Don't lump that thing in with us!

19:08.370 --> 19:12.520
Humans that can create such 
a thing are far more terrifying.

19:12.520 --> 19:14.680
Zenta's curse...

19:15.300 --> 19:19.220
If you monsters can't even 
handle it, there's nothing—

19:19.220 --> 19:20.430
Have no fear.

19:20.430 --> 19:24.510
We have already taken this matter 
to a certain someone.

19:24.510 --> 19:26.740
Our renowned goddess of wisdom!

19:26.740 --> 19:29.270
Our Lady of One Eye and One Leg!

19:29.620 --> 19:31.640
<i>Another yokai, eh?</i>

19:32.780 --> 19:34.650
You shall address me as "Lady."

19:35.070 --> 19:37.030
Hey, what's that look for?

19:37.030 --> 19:42.180
Our lady resolves any arguments or
quarrels we have among ourselves,

19:42.180 --> 19:45.180
as well as anything else.

19:45.180 --> 19:47.540
She is the goddess of wisdom!

19:47.540 --> 19:50.780
What's that supposed to mean? 
Talk about shady.

19:50.780 --> 19:56.370
And our lady will be here tomorrow evening.

19:56.370 --> 20:00.050
Therefore, this matter should 
be taken care of very soon.

20:00.330 --> 20:01.420
On that note, Tae-san,

20:01.780 --> 20:06.120
would it be all right if our 
lady stayed at your place?

20:06.120 --> 20:08.560
You trying to turn my place 
into a haunted house?

20:08.560 --> 20:12.560
Oh, no, no. Our lady has a human form.

20:12.560 --> 20:16.120
She is quite elegant, yet quite fierce.

20:16.940 --> 20:19.100
<i>Elegant and fierce?</i>

20:19.930 --> 20:22.200
Obey me!

20:22.200 --> 20:27.580
You're the one who knows the most 
about this supernatural incident, Tae-san.

20:27.580 --> 20:29.880
We would be eternally grateful

20:29.880 --> 20:33.550
if you could fill our lady 
in on all the details.

20:36.080 --> 20:38.650
<i>In for a penny, in for a pound, I guess.</i>

20:41.570 --> 20:43.720
<i>Considering the monsters I've seen tonight,</i>

20:43.720 --> 20:47.100
<i>I'm sure I won't be surprised by 
whatever this "our lady" looks like.</i>

20:48.490 --> 20:50.850
All right. I have plenty of rooms anyway.

20:50.850 --> 20:56.260
But make sure you tell that lady of yours 
to bring me a gift that I'll enjoy.

21:07.180 --> 21:08.370
My lady!

21:11.450 --> 21:12.710
It's a pleasure to meet you.

21:13.440 --> 21:17.380
My name is Iwanaga Kotoko. 
Thank you for inviting me to your home.

21:19.130 --> 21:23.260
You're "our lady"? Not exactly 
what I was told to expect.

21:23.260 --> 21:25.660
Are you a yokai in disguise?

21:25.660 --> 21:28.540
I hate to disappoint you, but I am a human 
who has parents and a family register.

21:28.540 --> 21:29.890
But if we want to get detailed,

21:29.890 --> 21:33.640
my right eye is fake, 
and my left leg is a prosthetic.

21:35.890 --> 21:40.890
And this is Sakuragawa Kuro. 
He will be assisting me.

21:40.890 --> 21:42.400
It's nice to meet you.

21:42.400 --> 21:44.780
<i>He seems normal.</i>

21:46.780 --> 21:48.480
<i>Normal?</i>

21:49.040 --> 21:53.460
My lady, we have been 
anxiously awaiting your arrival.

21:53.460 --> 21:56.250
And since Kuro-dono is with you,

21:56.250 --> 21:58.310
you'll be unstoppable, like the mighty Benkei.

21:58.310 --> 22:00.440
It should be smooth sailing from here!

22:00.440 --> 22:01.880
But before we get into that...

22:02.780 --> 22:06.870
Don't just go exposing yourself 
to a human without a good reason!

22:06.870 --> 22:11.440
You're just lucky she's kind enough 
not to go blabbing about you to others.

22:11.440 --> 22:13.390
I'm sorry! Terribly sorry!

22:13.390 --> 22:16.370
I felt as though it was safe to tell her,

22:16.370 --> 22:20.570
and even if Tae-san were to 
tell others that her cat talked,

22:20.570 --> 22:23.520
they would've just thought 
she'd gone senile,

22:23.520 --> 22:25.640
and it wouldn't have been a big deal.

22:25.640 --> 22:27.750
Well, I guess that is rather convenient.

22:27.750 --> 22:30.630
Don't you dare. I'm not going senile.

22:30.630 --> 22:32.230
I do beg your pardon.

22:32.230 --> 22:35.410
Now then, let's go take care 
of the matter at hand.

22:35.410 --> 22:39.170
Let's end things tonight 
if the doll shows up.

22:39.170 --> 22:41.670
<i>She sure makes it sound easy.</i>

22:41.670 --> 22:44.840
University will be starting up soon.

22:44.840 --> 22:47.850
Senpai, spring break will be over soon.

22:49.430 --> 22:51.670
That girl's in college?

22:51.670 --> 22:54.300
Why, yes. That is what I've been told.

22:54.300 --> 22:55.930
You should've told me that earlier!

22:55.930 --> 22:58.610
Asking a girl like that to get me a gift...

22:58.610 --> 23:01.200
I sound like a heartless old hag!

23:01.200 --> 23:04.510
I did mention that she was human.

23:04.510 --> 23:05.520
Excuse me.

23:06.190 --> 23:08.410
Thank you for letting us stay here.

23:08.410 --> 23:10.700
This isn't much, but please accept it.

23:11.060 --> 23:13.920
Well, thank you...

23:15.250 --> 23:16.700
Come on in.

23:16.700 --> 23:19.210
This is going to take a while to explain.

23:26.960 --> 23:29.970
To be continued
